[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4604506690","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/4927#issuecomment-4604506690","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4927","id":4604506690,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABEnMyQg","user":{"login":"soheilnikroo","id":62501144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTAxMTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62501144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo","html_url":"https://github.com/soheilnikroo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T16:30:26Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T09:35:57Z","body":"Thanks for the detailed request @Stusu  — I try to match a common pattern (PrimeReact-style “select all visible”).\n\nI’m working on this in https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4962 and started with Combobox.SelectAll, which:\n\nWorks in multiple modes (controlled and uncontrolled)\nToggles all currently filtered / visible items (respects the combobox filter)\nExposes checked, indeterminate, and disabled for styling (data-checked, data-indeterminate, etc.)\nUses `role=\"checkbox\"` and `aria-checked` for accessibility\nProposed usage  — place it above the list inside the popup (pinned header row):\n\n```\n<Combobox.Root items={items} multiple>\n  {/* ... */}\n  <Combobox.Popup>\n    <Combobox.SelectAll />\n    <Combobox.List>\n      {(item) => (\n        <Combobox.Item value={item}>{item.label}</Combobox.Item>\n      )}\n    </Combobox.List>\n  </Combobox.Popup>\n</Combobox.Root>\n```\n\nI didn’t add `Combobox.ListHeade`r yet, to keep the PR smaller. A plain wrapper (<div>) or your own styled row above <Combobox.List> should be enough to pin the control. If you still want a first-class ListHeader inside <Combobox.List> (as in your example), that’s a good follow-up — happy to discuss whether it should be layout-only or tied to list semantics (keyboard nav, virtualized lists, etc.).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4604506690/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4604889244","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/4927#issuecomment-4604889244","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4927","id":4604889244,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABEnkInA","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T17:06:58Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T17:20:13Z","body":"@Stusu You can achieve this in userland: https://stackblitz.com/edit/cthmvuwz?file=src%2FApp.tsx\n\n`Combobox.List` is a real `role=\"listbox\"` so it can't contain anything other than real options, so we need to hack a `Combobox.Item` for this. \n\nNot sure if we could have actual support for this as it would deviate from the ARIA combobox pattern though. The closest is this footnote from listbox:\n> If selecting or unselecting all options is an important function, implementing separate controls for these actions, such as buttons for \"Select All\" and \"Unselect All\", significantly improves accessibility.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4604889244/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4610069110","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/4927#issuecomment-4610069110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4927","id":4610069110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABEsgSdg","user":{"login":"soheilnikroo","id":62501144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTAxMTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62501144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo","html_url":"https://github.com/soheilnikroo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T07:31:10Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T07:31:10Z","body":"@mj12albert  Thanks for the Stackblitz — the `Item` + `filteredItems` approach makes sense for a select-all row *inside* the listbox.\n\nThis PR doesn’t put select-all inside `List`: `Combobox.SelectAll` is a `role=\"checkbox\"` button sibling to `List` in `Popup`, aligned with the listbox footnote about separate controls, and it doesn’t add a sentinel item to `value`.\n\nHappy to narrow to docs-only / the `Item` pattern if you’d prefer not to ship a new part.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4610069110/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4611088464","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/4927#issuecomment-4611088464","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4927","id":4611088464,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABEtegUA","user":{"login":"aarongarciah","id":7225802,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjU4MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7225802?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah","html_url":"https://github.com/aarongarciah","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aarongarciah/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T09:51:38Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T09:51:38Z","body":"@soheilnikroo it's better to have some common terms in the discussion before opening a PR that might not get reviewed/merged. It might seem like a minor thing, but increasing the API surface of a Base UI component is a big deal; we don't do that slightly.\n\nIn your [PR](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/4962), the newly added `Combobox.SelectAll` checkbox is not accessible.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4611088464/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4612227639","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/4927#issuecomment-4612227639","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4927","id":4612227639,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABEukCNw","user":{"login":"soheilnikroo","id":62501144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTAxMTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62501144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo","html_url":"https://github.com/soheilnikroo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T12:19:53Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T12:19:53Z","body":"Thanks @aarongarciah — fair points on both counts.\n\nI should have discussed this on the issue before opening a PR; I’m still learning Base UI’s process and didn’t treat the API surface with the care it deserves.\n\nI’ll close the PR unless you’d rather I narrow it to docs for the userland `Item` approach. Sorry for the noise, and thanks for the accessibility callout — happy to learn what specifically didn’t work in your testing if you can share.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4612227639/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4717127894","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/4927#issuecomment-4717127894","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4927","id":4717127894,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABGSmo1g","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-16T09:44:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-16T09:44:06Z","body":"> what specifically didn’t work\n\nThe main issue is that keyboard navigation will not reach it, hence the reason for hacking `Combobox.Item` ~","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4717127894/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4731456034","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/4927#issuecomment-4731456034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/4927","id":4731456034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs8AAAABGgRKIg","user":{"login":"soheilnikroo","id":62501144,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNTAxMTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62501144?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo","html_url":"https://github.com/soheilnikroo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/soheilnikroo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-17T14:26:53Z","updated_at":"2026-06-17T14:26:53Z","body":"Thanks @aarongarciah — that makes sense, and sorry for opening the PR before aligning on the approach.\n\nYou’re right: keyboard navigation couldn’t reach the original `Combobox.SelectAll` because it was a separate `role=\"checkbox\"` control outside the `role=\"listbox\"`. I’ve updated the PR so `Combobox.SelectAll` is implemented as a `Combobox.Item` (same idea as the Stackblitz `Item` hack), placed as the first child inside `Combobox.List`, with `preventBaseUIHandler()` so the sentinel value isn’t added to the selection. Arrow keys + Enter now reach it, and there’s a test for that.\n\nI also updated `Combobox.List` to allow a static `<Combobox.SelectAll />` sibling before the collection render function.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/4731456034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]